# Draw-capture assertions (afterhours capture::): prove what was painted
# instead of inferring it from screenshots. On the sokol backend capture
# records primitive shapes (triangle/circle/line/quad); text and rectangle
# ops are not recorded yet, so assert on glyph triangles for now.
make_test_repo
resize 1280 720
wait_frames 5
expect_drawn triangle min_count=100
expect_not_drawn quad
expect_draw_calls_below 20000
expect_text_i readme.md
dump_focus
screenshot draw_assertions
